 ("C","At least five singular clues, plus compound clues that need several scenes.","Dillon Q&A, Jun 21 2025"),
 ("C","Two 'super obvious' hints: 'It's either episode two or three. It is a scene that does not have me in it. But it was a scene that I had some control over. If you rewatch it, it'll be pretty obvious.' By Sep 27 2025 he said people had figured these out.","Dillon Q&A, Jun 21 2025; Sandal livestream"),
 ("C","The lawyer / Carl scene: zero clues.","Dillon Q&A, Jun 21 2025"),
