 ("C","At least four trips from the car, all within a 24-hour span, with a broken tibia, not in his own vehicle.","Seekers Summit, Mar 28 2026"),
 ("C","'Anonymous travel is very hard… my route was convoluted… I did it twice.' He has never returned and has no plans to.","Seekers Summit, Mar 28 2026"),
 ("S","He aimed to leave no digital footprint of the journey, and filmed the description of the treasure for Netflix only just before release so production staff had no advantage.","Public statements (research report)"),
